    turnFlow: 'A gap may be filled only by the card that is one rank higher and the same suit as the card immediately to its left. A gap at the far left of a row can be filled only by a 2. Gaps immediately right of a King are dead until redeal. When no legal move exists, gather all cards that are not part of correct left-to-right suit runs, redeal them into the open spaces, and continue. Standard Gaps allows two redeals, for up to three passes total.',
